{"v":4,"catch":"來自 UGSF 的緊急命令！網路突擊隊，鎮壓 AI 叛亂！","desc":"《CYBER COMMANDO》是NAMCO LIMITED（現為Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於 1994 年推出的動作遊戲。\n駕駛你的載具，奮戰以阻止太空殖民地爆發的安保電腦故障。\n鎖定目標並在千鈞一髮之際發射飛彈的刺激感，結合每種載具獨有的多樣化戰術，將這場終極一對一對決推向高潮！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2026-04-30","genres":["街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5e45f14d766d13749f6bee4ff1447344b0eff4092a39b312fa77d953957e0bab.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2f18572bfb1b4a27f16a8a6a852a49917e8bf3a9c3bc42a75c29296455a18537.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/24865ca3873d82b6d0ea665dfae69f916cebc3d0ade3e72cc1ab213a657fadc0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/460df22d08e1a99de43fd08eccc71d6d3d4f5b99567a11c92e2ade506eacc05b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a6fae3c55287de4ed686f503880db7dd4759e6c83196922b588dd1617a141493.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5cd23ff664be8a36b7f2aa0975633be7e13e5d37d0a3c371970f17871cddd6f6.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b6c02749c000","dlc":[]}